{"assets":["/statement-assets/64fb970d48bdda1f38cc25b48842a0056152830fe8a351ec9d92458d761939a4.png","/statement-assets/710d75a92653c4193818bccff56872b1c4cbdc215815cf30aac8715c1af9b6e4.png","/statement-assets/918ae328561039fff9e1e68500c2d4650282cca270cdfb6bec5625485afc5c34.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1173","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Nauuo and Chess"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Nauuo is a girl who loves playing chess."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One day she invented a game by herself which needs $$$n$$$ chess pieces to play on a $$$m\\times m$$$ chessboard. The rows and columns are numbered from $$$1$$$ to $$$m$$$. We denote a cell on the intersection of the $$$r$$$-th row and $$$c$$$-th column as $$$(r,c)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The game's goal is to place $$$n$$$ chess pieces numbered from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$ on the chessboard, the $$$i$$$-th piece lies on $$$(r_i,\\,c_i)$$$, while the following rule is satisfied: for all pairs of pieces $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$, $$$|r_i-r_j|+|c_i-c_j|\\ge|i-j|$$$. Here $$$|x|$$$ means the absolute value of $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"However, Nauuo discovered that sometimes she couldn't find a solution because the chessboard was too small."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"She wants to find the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"smallest"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" chessboard on which she can put $$$n$$$ pieces according to the rules."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"She also wonders how to place the pieces on such a chessboard. Can you help her?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1\\le n\\le 1000$$$) — the number of chess pieces for the game."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer — the minimum value of $$$m$$$, where $$$m$$$ is the length of sides of the suitable chessboard."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the next $$$n$$$ lines contains two integers $$$r_i$$$ and $$$c_i$$$ ($$$1\\le r_i,c_i\\le m$$$) — the coordinates of the $$$i$$$-th chess piece."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple answers, print any."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n1 1\n1 2"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n1 1\n1 3\n3 1\n3 3"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, you can't place the two pieces on a $$$1\\times1$$$ chessboard without breaking the rule. But you can place two pieces on a $$$2\\times2$$$ chessboard like this:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/64fb970d48bdda1f38cc25b48842a0056152830fe8a351ec9d92458d761939a4.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, you can't place four pieces on a $$$2\\times2$$$ chessboard without breaking the rule. For example, if you place the pieces like this:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/710d75a92653c4193818bccff56872b1c4cbdc215815cf30aac8715c1af9b6e4.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"then $$$|r_1-r_3|+|c_1-c_3|=|1-2|+|1-1|=1$$$, $$$|1-3|=2$$$, $$$1 \\lt 2$$$; and $$$|r_1-r_4|+|c_1-c_4|=|1-2|+|1-2|=2$$$, $$$|1-4|=3$$$, $$$2 \\lt 3$$$. It doesn't satisfy the rule."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"However, on a $$$3\\times3$$$ chessboard, you can place four pieces like this:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/918ae328561039fff9e1e68500c2d4650282cca270cdfb6bec5625485afc5c34.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1173B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1173/problem/B"}